**CEL compiles the filter string to an AST; `parser.go` walks that AST into a dialect-agnostic condition IR; `render.go` walks the IR and emits parameterized SQL (`?` for SQLite/MySQL, `$N` for Postgres) using dialect-specific functions for JSON, timestamps, text matching, and tag comprehensions.**

