## 5. Dialect-specific SQL in `render.go`

All three dialects share the same IR; differences are in the renderer:

| Concern | SQLite | MySQL | PostgreSQL |
|--------|--------|-------|------------|
| Placeholders | `?` | `?` | `$1`, `$2`, … |
| Timestamps | epoch columns as-is | `UNIX_TIMESTAMP(col)` | epoch columns as-is |
| Timestamp accessors | `strftime(..., 'unixepoch')` | `YEAR(col)`, `MONTH(col)`, … | `EXTRACT(... FROM to_timestamp(col) AT TIME ZONE 'UTC')` |
